      "body": "> it feels orthogonal to most of the concerns of click\n\nYes, this is a general problem with the pallets libraries exposing so many utilities and customization points. We're trying to clean this up in general. See for example the next Werkzeug 3.2 release, which is a huge wall of deprecations.",
